{"articleNo":"377787","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=view&articleNo=377787&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[교외행사] Call for Papers and Invitation to Participate in The 1st Conference on Sustainability and Emerging Technologies - CSET","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2022.06.17","hit":"4504","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:black\">Greetings\nfrom Dong Nai Technology University (DNTU), Vietnam.<br>\n<br>\nCall for Papers and Invitation to Participate in&nbsp; <b>The 1st Conference on\nSustainability and Emerging Technologies - CSET 2022</b><br>\n<br>\nWith all due respect, we are pleased and honoured to invite you to our upcoming\nconference&nbsp; <b>\"The1st Conference on Sustainability &amp; Emerging\nTechnologies – CSET 2022\"</b>&nbsp;to be held&nbsp; <b><u>online</u></b>&nbsp;during\n\"November 26, 2022\" by Dong Nai Technology University (DNTU). The\nmain theme of the conference is&nbsp; <b><i>\"Interdisciplinary technology\npromotes innovation and sustainability\".&nbsp;</i></b> <o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:black\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:black\">This\nonline conference will offer presentations on a wide range of topics to\nfacilitate the interdisciplinary exchange of ideas in engineering and\ntechnology areas, and foster various types of academic collaborations. Keynote\nspeakers from prestigious universities in Korea, India, and Vietnam will attend\nthe conference, including: <o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\nmargin-left:47.25pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\nmso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:black\">Prof. Dr. Hadiyanto</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:black\">&nbsp;– Center of Biomass and\nRenewable Energy (CBIORE), Diponegoro University, Indonesia<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\nmargin-left:47.25pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\nmso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:black\">Dr. Sung Hoon Jung&nbsp;</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:black\">– Department of Materials\nScience and Engineering, Gachon University, Korea<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\nmargin-left:47.25pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\nmso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:black\">Dr. Mitesh G. Mapari&nbsp;</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:black\">– Department of Chemistry,\nMumbai University, Mumbai, Maharashtra, India<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:black\"><br>\n<b>IMPORTANT DATES</b> <o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\nmargin-left:47.25pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\nmso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:black\">Registration and full file\nsubmission deadline:&nbsp;</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;\ncolor:black\">15 October 2022<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\nmargin-left:47.25pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\nmso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:black\">Notification of acceptance:</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:black\">&nbsp;31 October 2022<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\nmargin-left:47.25pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\nmso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:black\">Conference date:</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:black\">&nbsp;26 November 2022<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\nmargin-left:47.25pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\nmso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:black\">Word template:</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:black\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/Cset22word\" target=\"_blank\">https://tinyurl.com/Cset22word</a><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\nmargin-left:47.25pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\nmso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:black\">Conference fee:</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:black\">&nbsp;zero cost<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><i><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:black\">Please\nkindly find the invitation file attached below.</span></i><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:black\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:black\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:black\">We\nhope that you will join this symposium to exchange ideas, communicate fruitful\ncollaborations, and make this conference a success.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:black\">Thank\nyou.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:black\">&nbsp;</span><i><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:black\">-</span></i></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:black\">For\nmore information, please contact:<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><i><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:blue\">Assoc.\nProf. Dr. Hoang Anh Tuan - Chair of CSET 2022&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></i></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:black\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:black\">Phone:\n+84 (0)868.864.720<br>\nEmail:&nbsp; <a href=\"mailto:ntluan1707@gmail.com\" target=\"_blank\">ntluan1707@gmail.com</a><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:black\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:black\">Or:&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><i><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:blue\">Institute\nof Research and Applied Technological Science (IRATS)</span></i></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:black\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:굴림;mso-bidi-font-family:\n굴림;color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:KO;mso-bidi-language:\nAR-SA\">Phone: +84 (0)251.625.33.99 (Mr. Truong Tan Trung)<br>\nE-mail:&nbsp; <a href=\"mailto:viennckh@dntu.edu.vn\" target=\"_blank\">viennckh@dntu.edu.vn</a><br>\n<!--[if !supportLineBreakNewLine]--><br>\n<!--[endif]--></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
